OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEffigy of Fifa president chosen
OL,4,Afor bonfire event
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifa president Gianni Infantino has
OL,7,Fbeen unveiled as this year's effigy for
OL,8,FEdenbridge Bonfire Society's annual
OL,9,Fcelebration.
OL,11,FThe society said Infantino had been
OL,12,Fchosen for its celebration in the Kent
OL,13,Ftown on Saturday after making a "string
OL,14,Fof decisions that have left their mark
OL,15,Fon the world of football in the wake of
OL,16,Fthe World Cup".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
