OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEffigy of Fifa president chosen
OL,4,Afor bonfire event
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrevious celebrity targets have
OL,7,Fincluded former Prime Minister Sir Keir
OL,8,FStarmer, and US President Donald Trump,
OL,9,Fwho is also included in the effigy
OL,10,Fafter Infantino gave him the new Fifa
OL,11,FPeace Prize this year.
OL,13,FElon Musk, Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,14,Fand Housing Secretary Angela Rayner
OL,15,Fwere among the other nominations from
OL,16,Fthe public, the society said.
